   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "In the animated movie <i>Toy Story</i>, if Paul Newman turned down the role of voicing Woody, then Tom Hanks was chosen for the role. Tom Hanks was chosen as the voice for Woody, therefore, Paul Newman turned down the role of voicing Woody in <i>Toy Story</i>.",
